WEBVTT

00:08:27.503 --> 00:08:30.130
as long as you leave them alone
and you look after them.

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:32.841
So ...

00:08:33.467 --> 00:08:35.678
If you think these numbers are big,

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:39.557
wait till you see
what I'm about to tell you next.

00:08:39.598 --> 00:08:41.392
In seagrass alone,

00:08:41.433 --> 00:08:43.644
seagrass alone, carbon sequestration.

00:08:44.353 --> 00:08:47.606
How much do you think
is the value of the global --

00:08:47.606 --> 00:08:49.567
If you look at globally the seagrass

00:08:49.567 --> 00:08:52.987
and you value their
carbon sequestration service,

00:08:52.987 --> 00:08:54.863
how much you think it's worth?

00:08:54.863 --> 00:08:56.115
You ready?

00:08:56.907 --> 00:08:59.910
2.3 trillion dollars.

00:08:59.952 --> 00:09:03.622
That's the size
of the German stock market.